Richard,

You have a Java Runtime Environment (JRE) installed, not the
Java Development Kit (JDK).

The JRE includes stuff for compiling java files, and for other programs 
linking
into java (like JRI).

Download and install a java JDK from 
http://www.java.com/en/download/manual.jsp
to fix your problem.

C


