From: Richard.Percy at lloyds.com (Percy, Richard)
Date: Thu, 22 Feb 2007 09:21:51 -0000
Subject: RE: JGR linux installation problem - no java.h
In-Reply-To: <45DA15A3.5070606@dcs.gla.ac.uk>
